      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    cash_flows = [8, 10, 12, 15, 18]\n    discount_rate = 0.08\n    terminal_value_multiple = 4\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value_of_cash_flows = sum(\n        cash_flow / ((1 + discount_rate) ** year)\n        for year, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows, start=1)\n    )\n    terminal_value = cash_flows[-1] * terminal_value_multiple\n    present_value_of_terminal_value = terminal_value / (\n        (1 + discount_rate) ** len(cash_flows)\n    )\n    answer = round(\n        present_value_of_cash_flows + present_value_of_terminal_value, 2\n    )\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
